/*
  DrivingTab.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0056 · DrivingTab (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `DrivingTab` resolves (table "DrivingTab") lives here with its web English value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own
  strings without editing the shared catalog.

